WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670 line:90%
They say there is no US soldier

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.300 line:90%
in Afghanistan.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.810 line:90%
I'm here and I'll help as long

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.970 line:90%
as it takes I came here to get

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.070 line:90%
my family out I couldn't do

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.920 line:90%
so but I've helped plenty

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.710 line:90%
of other people and it feels

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.690 line:90%
good getting them up saving them

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.490 line:90%
from the Taliban it feels good

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.990 line:90%
but I've gotten out several

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.770 line:90%
minorities Catholics Christians

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.930 line:90%
hijra minorities and other

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.960 line:90%
individuals and upwards of 30

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.800 line:90%
individuals that I've helped it

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.020 line:90%
out to Pakistan when I came

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.940 line:90%
to the US just a few days before

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:41.520 line:90%
9/11 didn't have anything I

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.940 line:90%
still wore Afghan clothes

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.430 line:90%
and a turban I went to high

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.840 line:90%
school finished high school

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.950 line:90%
and then I came across

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.360 line:90%
a recruiter and I joined the US

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.680 line:90%
Army right now I'm in Pakistan

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:51.480 line:90%
but I

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.040 line:90%
came about a month ago and I

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.990 line:90%
went to Afghanistan but it's not

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.150 line:90%
the official crossing I came I

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.560 line:90%
got went in and out several

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.110 line:90%
times oftentimes bringing more

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.600 line:90%
people in the game those that

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.030 line:90%
have lives those that have

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.920 line:90%
handlers in Islamabad

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.580 line:90%
or Peshawar waiting for them

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.520 line:90%
they just need help get them

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.710 line:90%
in because of that closed border

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.240 line:90%
I've come across many different

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.920 line:90%
groups here I came across

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.000 line:90%
a family of 10 Afghan Christians

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.880 line:90%
who needed to be moved and we

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.740 line:90%
helped move them

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:30.750 line:90%
and we're hoping their past that

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.010 line:90%
have already made it out you

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.090 line:90%
guys just went to visit

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.160 line:90%
my family help my mom and dad I

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.220 line:90%
greatly appreciate that,

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.220 line:90%
man I just want to thank you

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.570 line:90%
you're doing a risky job

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.240 line:90%
but still you're the man bro was

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.690 line:90%
a Catholic husband and wife that

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:48.510 line:90%
needed help to get to Pakistan

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.680 line:90%
and they were in danger

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.660 line:90%
because of their religion they

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.670 line:90%
have converted to Catholicism

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.050 line:90%
recently everyone

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.580 line:90%
in their neighborhood knew about

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.350 line:90%
it and they saw snitching

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:01.170 line:90%
on them this case reached me I

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:03.060 line:90%
agreed to help them they crossed

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.100 line:90%
into Pakistan but not

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.200 line:90%
the official crossing

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.360 line:90%
but instead we sought help from

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.970 line:90%
the Afghan nomads and they

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.440 line:90%
illegally crossed them

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:16.770 line:90%
in on my way back from this area

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.480 line:90%
I got caught by the Taliban

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.730 line:90%
and they lashed me on my back I

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:21.720 line:90%
told them I was a cigarette

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:22.590 line:90%
smuggler

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.450 line:90%
and that's why I think it was

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.990 line:90%
only seven times.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:28.170 line:90%
But had they known that I had

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:30.210 line:90%
actually just held a Catholic

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.710 line:90%
family get out it would have

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.610 line:90%
been worse, far worse.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:35.760 line:90%
I started feeling chills I spoke

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.990 line:90%
to a medic friend of mine

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.360 line:90%
in the US Army Special forces

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.240 line:90%
medic and he was probably

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:42.040 line:90%
infected.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.130 line:90%
So I took some Tylenol and a few

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.410 line:90%
other pills And it got better

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.610 line:90%
we're not proud of the American

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.500 line:90%
soldiers taking a note

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.270 line:90%
and I'll never forget that I

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.890 line:90%
pleaded for help from the US

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:56.530 line:90%
government I did not receive any

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.650 line:90%
needed help to get my family out

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.100 line:90%
my journalist needs Afghanistan

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.470 line:90%
but it didn't work out I had no

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.900 line:90%
choice but to come here myself

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.360 line:90%
after I learned that there was

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.420 line:90%
an ambush on my family's House

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.580 line:90%
once more I still haven't heard

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.490 line:90%
any anything from our government

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:20.130 line:90%
as far as any sort of assistance

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.190 line:90%
my family is currently at a safe

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.100 line:90%
House alone by themselves just

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.270 line:90%
the family of six the Taliban

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.400 line:90%
have this thing called the

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.200 line:90%
photo album let's call it they

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.060 line:90%
have photos of high value

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.770 line:90%
individuals that they're looking

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.620 line:90%
for we heard that my niece is

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.510 line:90%
one of those individuals there

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.890 line:90%
was one incident where

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.090 line:90%
the Taliban showed up outside

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:43.440 line:90%
of the safe House my friends

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.960 line:90%
helped her move my family out

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.730 line:90%
of there and in the process

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.040 line:90%
my niece got injured chest

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.760 line:90%
trauma bruises and her thumb

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.040 line:90%
looked like it got broken

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.710 line:90%
but I'm not sure it's injured

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.990 line:90%
or very bad the injury healed

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.390 line:90%
but the fear from that day is

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.360 line:90%
still there.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.530 line:90%
My niece is extremely sick

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.080 line:90%
they're afraid we have brought

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.790 line:90%
five different doctors to see

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:15.660 line:90%
her she's given various types

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:18.029 line:90%
of injections and medication

00:04:18.029 --> 00:04:19.800 line:90%
but she's not getting better

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:22.770 line:90%
she's depressed she's afraid

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.140 line:90%
she's in really bad shape right

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:24.940 line:90%
now.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.360 line:90%
And on top of that I had this

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.260 line:90%
new place where

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.370 line:90%
they're at outside of Kabul.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.760 line:90%
They're low on water and food

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.170 line:90%
even the kids have barely

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.890 line:90%
anything to eat at this point

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:40.050 line:90%
my friends were watching

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.120 line:90%
and protecting their data

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.580 line:90%
or food whatever they can come

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.140 line:90%
up with they're giving it

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.960 line:90%
to my family even Pakistan here

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.510 line:90%
is not safe for my niece she is

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:54.630 line:90%
anti-taliban she has always

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.000 line:90%
spoken out about how this region

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.160 line:90%
does not stop at the border

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.910 line:90%
they're already in Pakistan.

